|RECORD=CatalogItem|ITEMTYPE=Automatic-NonVault|UNIQUEID=Schlib1.SchLib\CYPD3177-24LQXQ|DESIGNITEMID=CYPD3177-24LQXQ|ITEMSOURCE=Schlib1.SchLib|STATUS=Unknown|DESCRIPTION=EZ-PD™ Barrel Connector Replacement (BCR) CYPD3177-24LQXQ is the tray packing type option of EZ-PD™ BCR family, the highly-integrated USB Type-C port controllers for power sink applications. It targets electronic devices using legacy barrel connectors up to 100 W or USB micro-B for power inputs, enabling product designers to replace these incompatible connectors with USB-C.EZ-PD™ BCR complies with USB Type-C and USB 3.0 Power Delivery (PD) standards and enables users to quickly convert their devices from being powered through a barrel connector to being powered via the USB-C connector with few external components and no firmware development is required. It integrates a complete USB Type-C transceiver, USB PD policy manager, a load switch controller with a soft start, all termination resistors required for a USB Type-C port, and system-level ESD protection. It is available in a 24-pin QFN package.|USERCOMMENTS=CYPD3177-24LQXQ|NOTE=|LINENUMBER=|SELECTEDPARAMETERSHASH=CYPD3177-24LQXQ,"EZ-PD™ Barrel Connector Replacement (BCR) CYPD3177-24LQXQ is the tray packing type option of EZ-PD™ BCR family, the highly-integrated USB Type-C port controllers for power sink applications. It targets electronic devices using legacy barrel connectors up to 100 W or USB micro-B for power inputs, enabling product designers to replace these incompatible connectors with USB-C.EZ-PD™ BCR complies with USB Type-C and USB 3.0 Power Delivery (PD) standards and enables users to quickly convert their devices from being powered through a barrel connector to being powered via the USB-C connector with few external components and no firmware development is required. It integrates a complete USB Type-C transceiver, USB PD policy manager, a load switch controller with a soft start, all termination resistors required for a USB Type-C port, and system-level ESD protection. It is available in a 24-pin QFN package."|COMPONENTPARAMETERS=Comment=CYPD3177-24LQXQ,"Component Kind=Standard","Copyright=Copyright (C) 2026 Ultra Librarian. All rights reserved.","Description=EZ-PD™ Barrel Connector Replacement (BCR) CYPD3177-24LQXQ is the tray packing type option of EZ-PD™ BCR family, the highly-integrated USB Type-C port controllers for power sink applications. It targets electronic devices using legacy barrel connectors up to 100 W or USB micro-B for power inputs, enabling product designers to replace these incompatible connectors with USB-C.EZ-PD™ BCR complies with USB Type-C and USB 3.0 Power Delivery (PD) standards and enables users to quickly convert their devices from being powered through a barrel connector to being powered via the USB-C connector with few external components and no firmware development is required. It integrates a complete USB Type-C transceiver, USB PD policy manager, a load switch controller with a soft start, all termination resistors required for a USB Type-C port, and system-level ESD protection. It is available in a 24-pin QFN package.",Footprint=QFN24_CYPD3177_INF,"Ibis Model=","Library Name=Schlib1.SchLib","Library Reference=CYPD3177-24LQXQ","Manufacturer 1=Infineon","Manufacturer Part Number 1=CYPD3177-24LQXQT",Package=QFN-24(4x4),PCB3D=,"Pin Info=",RefDes=RefDes,"Signal Integrity=",Simulation=,"Supplier 1=LCSC","Supplier Part Number 1=C5904158","Supplier Unit Price 1=1.24",Type=Type|CUSTOMPARAMETERS=
